        "original_id": "597c6f81-b041-5c5e-8539-2facb903dfb4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Lakshyam (2007 film)\n- People: Anushka Shetty, Sweety Shetty, Gopichand, Jagapati Babu, Nallamalupu Srinivas (Bujji), Srivass, Mani Sharma\n- Companies: Sri Lakshmi Narasimha Productions\n- Topics: Telugu cinema, Tamil cinema\n\nFacts:\n- Anushka Shetty was born as Sweety Shetty on 7 November 1981.\n- Anushka Shetty is an Indian actress and model who predominantly works in Telugu and Tamil films.\n- Lakshyam is a 2007 Telugu action film.\n- Lakshyam was produced by Nallamalupu Srinivas (Bujji) under the Sri Lakshmi Narasimha Productions banner.\n- Lakshyam was directed by Srivass.\n- Lakshyam stars Gopichand, Jagapati Babu, and Anushka Shetty in lead roles.\n- Lakshyam has music composed by Mani Sharma.",
